        "content": "<p>Ever wanted to render Mermaid diagrams using pure roc ... well now there's a package for that, it lives in the roc-graph-layout package for now (I might give it it's own home some day).</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lukewilliamboswell/roc-graph-layout/releases/tag/0.3.0-rc3\">https://github.com/lukewilliamboswell/roc-graph-layout/releases/tag/0.3.0-rc3</a></p>\n<p>It's currently still a release candidate because I'm using it for my docs generation and I want to get all my repositories upgraded and reviewed before I finalise it. I keep finding things that need fixing or features etc. </p>\n<p>Here are some examples.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-29 at 15.13.03.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"908x1256\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/22008/QwkhtN7EzZf5LmNId4SQoQL0/Screenshot-2026-10-29-at-15.13.03.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/22008/QwkhtN7EzZf5LmNId4SQoQL0/Screenshot-2026-10-29-at-15.13.03.png/840x560.webp\"><br>\n<img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-29 at 15.13.18.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1188x1272\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/22008/d792ZtTOwG1Yk6SbQB7msERL/Screenshot-2026-10-29-at-15.13.18.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/22008/d792ZtTOwG1Yk6SbQB7msERL/Screenshot-2026-10-29-at-15.13.18.png/840x560.webp\"><br>\n<img alt=\"Screenshot 2026-10-29 at 15.13.49.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1194x396\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/22008/2fOpJWvh5HdBQLKrhbEMNm74/Screenshot-2026-10-29-at-15.13.49.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/22008/2fOpJWvh5HdBQLKrhbEMNm74/Screenshot-2026-10-29-at-15.13.49.png/840x560.webp\"></p>",
